{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20115","headline":"同李益崔放送王链师还楼观兼爲羣公先营山居 · 孟郊","name":"同李益崔放送王链师还楼观兼爲羣公先营山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十年白云士，一卷紫芝书。\n来结崆峒侣，还期缥缈居。\n霞冠遗彩翠，月帔上空虚。\n寄谢泉根水，清泠闲有余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}